<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title data-i18n-title="page.privacy.title">Privacy Policy</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles/main.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles/privacy.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles/cookie-banner.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/styles/language-switcher.css" />
</head>

<body data-page="privacy">
  <%- include("./partials/language-switcher.ejs") %>
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <section class="privacy-card" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
      <p class="privacy-eyebrow" data-i18n="privacy.eyebrow">Legal Compliance</p>
      <h1 id="privacy-title" data-i18n="privacy.title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-intro" data-i18n="privacy.intro">
        This policy explains how Taskify handles account, session, and preference data for this course project build.
      </p>

      <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.informationHeading">Information we store</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.informationBody">
          Taskify stores user account information such as username, email address, and task management related data that
          supports the app experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.sessionsHeading">Sessions and preferences</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.sessionsBody">
          Taskify uses session cookies to keep authenticated users signed in, and it may use localStorage to remember
          preferences such as cookie consent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.sharingHeading">Data sharing</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.sharingBody">
          Taskify does not sell user data to third parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2 data-i18n="privacy.endingHeading">Ending a session</h2>
        <p data-i18n="privacy.endingBody">
          Users can end an authenticated session by using the Log Out action, which clears the current session on the app.
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav class="privacy-links" aria-label="Privacy page links" data-i18n-aria-label="privacy.pageLinksLabel">
        <a href="/" data-i18n="privacy.backHome">Back to home</a>
        <a href="/signup" data-i18n="privacy.goToSignup">Go to sign up or login</a>
      </nav>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include("./partials/cookie-banner.ejs") %>
  <script src="/static/scripts/cookie-banner.js"></script>
  <script src="/static/scripts/i18n.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
